      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a start, but it feels a bit too \"on the one hand, on the other hand.\" i'm trying to get to the heart of the tension. specifically, does the opposition have actual logical arguments about the impact on the community, or is it more just a general feeling of being against change/privatization?",
